      "file": "web/src/components/receipts/receipt-data-table.tsx",
      "root_cause": "Hover suppression used `data-[disabled=true]:hover:bg-transparent`, which cancelled the row's own `bg-sidebar` while hovered. Hover stopped the muted highlight but introduced a different visible change (sidebar color -> transparent), so the row still reacted to the pointer.",
