      "error_message": "Table footer note did not participate in the table layout - no footer cell existed and the note sat outside the column model",
      "file": "web/src/components/receipts/receipt-data-table.tsx",
      "root_cause": "The footer was written as `<TableFooter className=\"p-3 flex items-center\"><span>..</span></TableFooter>`, i.e. a bare <span> directly inside <tfoot> plus display:flex on the <tfoot> itself. A table section may only contain <tr>, so the note was never wrapped in a cell and the section stopped behaving as a row group, which perturbs the shared column layout.",
